[00:01.34]1. Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[00:13.44]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[00:20.83]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[00:26.83]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[00:34.36]By his love God made provision;
[00:40.36]We may freely take his hand.
[00:46.36]So we make our dedication;
[00:49.34]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[00:58.34]2. In this day of Satan’s anger,
[01:04.34]As the end is drawing ever near,
[01:11.90]We are faced with opposition
[01:17.80]That could make us turn away in fear.
[01:25.44]But Jehovah gives protection;
[01:31.04]Close to him we want to stay,
[01:37.04]That we might forever serve him.
[01:43.04]Love him loyally, never stray.
[01:53.85]3. Help for us God has provided
[02:00.25]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[02:07.39]Through the Christian congregation,
[02:13.27]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[02:20.83]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[02:26.68]He will help us do what’s right.
[02:32.53]He will help us to be loyal
[02:39.33]And walk modestly in his sight.